  ('97b14d51-39b5-478d-b669-dbe1eddac1d4', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:6a5fb7911b9743318ccefbab', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1960s-movado-m90-breguet-chronograph-ref-19048-w-gay-freres-bracelet-unpolished', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW543","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-09-01T07:21:12.808Z","photoCount":10,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-07-21T18:19:34.945Z"},"text":"An extremely handsome and uncommon 1960s Movado M90 Chronograph ref. 19048 in an unpolished 35mm Francois Borgel screwback case with a beautiful dial with gold applied Breguet numerals, matching sword hands and the brands iconic serpentine chronograph hand, this is example paired on a rare and period correct stretch rivet Gay Freres bracelet. \nIt’s manually wound F. Piguet based in house modified M90 chronograph module is running and functioning well. We do not have service history.","title":"1960''s Movado M90 \"Breguet\" Chronograph ref. 19048 w/ Gay Freres Bracelet *Unpolished*","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/7e6db11f-0fb7-4ebd-b4ac-b069b5ffb77b/B0004116.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/1822ef30-1a20-4a84-b4f6-da4cbd43b752/B0004138.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/977f0208-4f62-48ab-8406-22521baf9845/B0004121.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/eacabe00-455e-404e-a9f9-07a44dd93ff8/B0004165.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/4fb04539-2748-4d34-b9ab-f27cebf08794/B0004160.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/221286cf-9ae0-4600-9be9-cebd337237dc/B0004155.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/f092e75d-f1ac-4083-b5a7-2aa80b07f96b/B0004147.jpg?