  ('696c2374-a45d-48ba-ae7f-b963255cea53', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:69e919b23af7d1473e749075', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1990s-ebel-voyager-worldtime-automatic-18k-yg-steel', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW457","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T18:02:03.085Z","photoCount":6,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-04-22T19:00:00.351Z"},"text":"A rad and seldom seen 1990s Ebel Voyager Worldtime GMT, a design that is quintessentially 90s that has endured, with its brushed 18K yellow gold bi-directional rotating bezel, stainless steel mid-case with the subtle curves that have come to the define the brand during their peak of popularity, contrasting tone on tone map of the world dial with rotating 24 hour chapter ring, all powered by a self-winding Ebel caliber. \nThis watch comes with its steel Ebel signed deployant buckle, sharkskin strap and Japanese service papers. Its case measures 37mm, 41mm from widest point to crown.","title":"1990''s Ebel Voyager Worldtime Automatic 18K YG & Steel","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/05f6a832-f1c7-4b5e-bd74-daf559b4966a/DSC00104.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/f20b00e9-17ce-4685-96b6-770c56f6aa5d/DSC00166.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/cda2a98c-e44f-406f-9e41-7790572b8b6c/DSC00123.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/188739d8-5f29-4df9-92dd-b0aafc707977/DSC00130.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/15037d6d-9da3-46b1-abdc-80ef9afb29c4/DSC00176.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/3d1fb5d2-949c-4b37-9785-b5f4aa7d632d/DSC00137.jpg?format=1500w"],"sourceUrl":"https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1990s-ebel-voyager-worldtime-automatic-18k-yg-steel","externalId":"squarespace:69e919b23af7d1473e749075","priceCents":599500}'::jsonb, 'f856e947854daade578e9b2294736313bc4426f60050fd54f62e6934c3b4d6b4', '28fbe7c915da7e46c0496117decbafe9459db279c984c2b6cbf5df0069526453', true, true, '{"year":1990,"brand":"Ebel","model":"Voyager","style":"gmt","caliber":"Ebel","has_box":null,"winding":"automatic","currency":"USD","brand_key":"ebel","condition":null,"reference":null,"dial_color":null,"has_papers":true,"description":"This 1990s Ebel Voyager Worldtime GMT features a bi-directional rotating bezel and a tone on tone world map dial. It is powered by a self-winding Ebel caliber and comes with a sharkskin strap and Japanese service papers.","price_cents":599500,"case_size_mm":37,"case_material":"two_tone","complications":["gmt"]}'::jsonb, 'f856e947854daade578e9b2294736313bc4426f60050fd54f62e6934c3b4d6b4', '28fbe7c915da7e46c0496117decbafe9459db279c984c2b6cbf5df0069526453', '3dd88400e7a6a017e246a3e9a99dc468a942d4cd951727c186871533f10fe408', null, 'b7a6b264-d5e3-4be8-8314-9fdc44d53841', '2026-09-14T15:48:11.878242+00:00', '2026-09-22T01:08:52.208+00:00'),
  ('dbff3177-c726-4061-96c6-8e3a27bb58c4', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:6a5e822e22d8fb7a65bd08fc', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1950s-rolex-oyster-perpetual-ref-6084-14k-yg-w-black-gilt-waffle-dial', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW542","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-09-01T07:12:06.214Z","photoCount":10,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-07-20T20:18:37.990Z"},"text":"A fantastic and uncommon Rolex Oyster Perpetual ref. 6084 in a super sharp solid 14K yellow gold case measuring a pleasing 34mm, with a gorgeous gilt waffle “OCC” dial and its original radium lume, Super Oyster crown and powered by the self-winding Rolex caliber 645 which is running well and keeping accurate time.","title":"1950''s Rolex Oyster Perpetual ref. 6084 14K YG w/ Black Gilt Waffle Dial","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/19e5672c-8f2f-4bc3-ac40-a2c141dc78c7/B0004038.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/38202a11-f2b1-4c24-9135-56195c24c7e2/B0004088.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/30e51778-2b9b-4723-917e-cba60b84eb6c/B0004060.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/077aaa51-fca5-4cae-999d-434749059d49/B0004078.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/b8f17ee6-f63d-4a05-87ed-7cb6d3730a05/B0004112.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/aad29f25-0938-47e4-a41f-57943cd2e55b/B0004082.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/11b1ed96-c515-4f7a-b522-1e6977ec9444/B0004110.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/7e6e684d-274e-432e-af7c-9a8f6b5abb2c/B0004099.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/56d87202-06b8-49f7-adb4-f499da07605e/B0004086.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/0bd6bee6-b132-44f8-a4d9-89ddef1879df/B0004051.jpg?format=1500w"],"sourceUrl":"https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1950s-rolex-oyster-perpetual-ref-6084-14k-yg-w-black-gilt-waffle-dial","externalId":"squarespace:6a5e822e22d8fb7a65bd08fc","priceCents":1599500}'::jsonb, 'bd8bd67f56b224d68d104b761285c6c99c10ce801f5a725f20727071f5336806', '305288b46ed63a0ec7a4eb4a14665da02fda5a57ef10db3b091348028a816bb7', true, true, '{"year":1950,"brand":"Rolex","model":"Oyster Perpetual","style":"dress","caliber":"Cal. 645","has_box":null,"winding":"automatic","currency":"USD","brand_key":"rolex","condition":null,"reference":"6084","dial_color":"black","has_papers":null,"description":"This Rolex Oyster Perpetual ref. 6084 features a solid 14K yellow gold case and a beautiful gilt waffle dial with original radium lume.","price_cents":1599500,"case_size_mm":34,"case_material":"yellow_gold","complications":[]}'::jsonb, 'bd8bd67f56b224d68d104b761285c6c99c10ce801f5a725f20727071f5336806', '305288b46ed63a0ec7a4eb4a14665da02fda5a57ef10db3b091348028a816bb7', 'b06fb305dc9376c0abaaa5c21faa5522fab7624317af1a5218759ef67a2b5c04', null, '603f08a9-1205-4aa4-8afa-83d0e84834bc', '2026-09-14T15:48:11.878242+00:00', '2026-09-22T01:08:52.208+00:00'),
  ('d6d3ab09-5a20-4995-b7b2-9ec2e3f950a4', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:69f3aede2f83637c43a45750', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1940s-longines-chronostop-chronograph-lnos-10k-gf', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW464","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T19:23:38.467Z","photoCount":11,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-04-30T19:37:35.089Z"},"text":"A nearly mint and extremely handsome 1940s Longines Chronostop Chronograph in a sharp 10K gold filled 31mm case, broad faceted lugs and a nearly flawless applied Breguet numeral dial, its matching and likely original gold filled Longines signed buckle. \nThis ingenious take on the chronograph is unlike most, with its chronograph seconds designed to constantly run, its minute timing blue steeled hand vertically aligned. This allows for a completely symmetrical dial layout. And before you say “I will find one in solid gold” - they did not make them. Gold filled examples are the only way into one of these, and without hyperbole, this is the nicest one to exist. Period. \nIt comes with a period correct Longines box as well. We do not have service history but this watch is running and functioning well.","title":"1940''s Longines Chronostop Chronograph \"LNOS\" 10K GF","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/9f8c3467-cb6b-43e0-8167-ad8b801b2e88/DSC00871.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/7a671ee5-be77-4ba9-9667-8fb1c24b4b48/DSC00925.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/85614213-7c00-47aa-9478-761498a348f8/DSC00877.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/d6ba720a-4b78-4820-b564-da24b1ed9e5e/DSC00891.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/6122fda2-2023-4c74-b4de-02992ee1782f/DSC00916.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/14629ab3-25bc-45cb-8bf8-f139f5da5141/DSC00929.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/7cf1ce2f-9013-4349-9ff1-fb5042af865c/DSC00930.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/c7911143-b075-41a3-aa58-6271fde36f68/DSC00935.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/cf440479-ac83-4743-a347-458769791a29/DSC00941.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/8a975d7a-7d78-48c0-9ec6-78406afb3ec6/DSC00961.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/c85522f1-2b98-4db6-965d-a8f492e8b27d/DSC00965.jpg?format=1500w"],"sourceUrl":"https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1940s-longines-chronostop-chronograph-lnos-10k-gf","externalId":"squarespace:69f3aede2f83637c43a45750","priceCents":699500}'::jsonb, '8684e3116ac49d45907b4015d890c8e857bef9c10ab88ed0c2d23f13266a4f97', 'db67f0a9d317d38eb8d0549842a0f968478da2ef1b016a9ffbe020dee8f12568', true, true, '{"year":1940,"brand":"Longines","model":"Chronostop","style":"chronograph","caliber":null,"has_box":true,"winding":null,"currency":"USD","brand_key":"longines","condition":"nearly mint","reference":null,"dial_color":"other","has_papers":null,"description":"A nearly mint and extremely handsome 1940s Longines Chronostop Chronograph in a sharp 10K gold filled case, featuring a nearly flawless applied Breguet numeral dial. This unique chronograph allows for a symmetrical dial layout with a constantly running seconds hand.","price_cents":699500,"case_size_mm":31,"case_material":"yellow_gold","complications":["chronograph"]}'::jsonb, '8684e3116ac49d45907b4015d890c8e857bef9c10ab88ed0c2d23f13266a4f97', 'db67f0a9d317d38eb8d0549842a0f968478da2ef1b016a9ffbe020dee8f12568', '9df91b243054922ae6958f0dd2c6810c37aa0da60d4d826cfe0c7c52cbec2fca', null, 'eb63e818-42d4-41e7-8fa7-ce2e7f2950f5', '2026-09-14T15:48:11.878242+00:00', '2026-09-22T01:08:52.208+00:00'),
  ('7313cafe-1f4e-4f26-b9b4-17fb11fafe3e', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:6a552b45b48e7b64b82e1e3f', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1940s-alpina-tank-w-black-gilt-dial-new-old-stock', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW536","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-09-01T06:10:14.450Z","photoCount":8,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-07-13T18:17:02.453Z"},"text":"An incredibly handsome new old stock Alpina Tank from the 1940s, in a large 38mm x 23mm stainless steel case, with hooded articulating lugs and a glossy silver gilt black dial with enough luster to light up a dark room, every bit of this watch is like new and never worn, with sharp case bevels, satin brushing and minimal dial wear, seeing a watch like this yields an appreciation for how these were meant to be experienced right from the factory. \nThis watch comes with its Alpina handle tag and while it is running well, we assume this has never been serviced and will leave as is unless requested.","title":"1940''s Alpina Tank w/ Black Gilt Dial *New Old Stock*","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/652ddc8d-78c3-4077-b789-93f2be702733/B0003613.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/02a6fb83-67a5-449d-9e25-0dd4abb476d6/B0003668.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/7c18af49-a377-4416-b4ec-52cb4c9d2521/B0003654.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/5ddbd7d0-b591-44ea-ae12-5760b52d67ec/B0003649.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/6075fca7-0340-4053-8d35-ba4a045d7ae0/B0003646.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/124d165c-4132-4791-bdd6-fdaab1ed4b5b/B0003642.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/8c3c48bf-3890-4c73-8eb8-c944354523f5/B0003636.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/5e0b70a1-a618-4ed9-9bf6-7640606c081c/B0003627.jpg?format=1500w"],"sourceUrl":"https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1940s-alpina-tank-w-black-gilt-dial-new-old-stock","externalId":"squarespace:6a552b45b48e7b64b82e1e3f","priceCents":399500}'::jsonb, 'f7d50a85592075117f05284f5ec5d8c1270b3eafb2b770a758d31b9fe53f56f0', '17d311c68f87e224da11fadc572e49195f278ea16f9d3c84d7d3a4ba87184e78', true, true, '{"year":1940,"brand":"Alpina","model":"Tank","style":"dress","caliber":null,"has_box":null,"winding":null,"currency":"USD","brand_key":"alpina","condition":"new old stock","reference":null,"dial_color":"black","has_papers":null,"description":"An incredibly handsome new old stock Alpina Tank from the 1940s, in a large 38mm x 23mm stainless steel case, with hooded articulating lugs and a glossy silver gilt black dial. This watch comes with its Alpina handle tag and while it is running well, we assume this has never been serviced.","price_cents":399500,"case_size_mm":38,"case_material":"steel","complications":[]}'::jsonb, 'f7d50a85592075117f05284f5ec5d8c1270b3eafb2b770a758d31b9fe53f56f0', '17d311c68f87e224da11fadc572e49195f278ea16f9d3c84d7d3a4ba87184e78', '30f2c56b28cdc60a6c43e172189970a555c993db1020a1d13aabdc29700cd51c', null, 'b8f7f92e-e3ca-468b-be28-e6645a26f8cd', '2026-09-14T15:48:11.878242+00:00', '2026-09-22T01:08:52.208+00:00'),
