  ('bd80a189-df18-4f51-8012-eaf3a0a6e49d', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:6a3b42beac41db618c42b33f', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1950s-patek-philippe-ref-2950-disco-volante-retailed-by-beyer', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW515","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-09-01T03:24:45.068Z","photoCount":8,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-06-24T02:38:29.529Z"},"text":"A fabulous 1950s Patek Philippe ref. 2590 “Disco Volante” retailed and doubled signed by the legendary Beyer of Z&uuml;rich, whose relationship with the brand spans over two centuries, in 18K yellow gold with hidden T shaped lugs, this 34mm 18K yellow gold wristwatch wears large yet svelt on the wrist, its dial with slight aging around its perimeter, has a perfect Patek champlev&eacute; signature at 12 o’clock, and its Beyer text sharp as ever, its manually wound Patek caliber running well. \nWe filed for Patek extract and will ship to the buyer upon receipt. We do not have service history however his watch is running well.","title":"1950''s Patek Philippe ref. 2590 \"Disco Volante\" Retailed by Beyer","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/551cb113-0a2a-4472-b518-fef7d09b74d5/B0002587.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/b3522266-4b18-454c-a5ea-6ddf4f3cf1a1/B0002589.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/69e05e73-dfe8-492c-b55b-7d206e8a6216/B0002600.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/776d8232-8166-48ac-9680-beee07c315ba/B0002604.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/cdb2dc17-7cda-4789-9cb5-fca1b0f21576/B0002612.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/750a28ab-cae2-4ca1-af65-a793d9f4c723/B0002628.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squ