/p/1940s-patek-philippe-calatrava-ref-1543-fancy-lugs-18k-yg","externalId":"squarespace:6a0cf61168dc3c55cb47fd47","priceCents":1699500}'::jsonb, 'c7315399e662784e3c80edd3b2e390c6791d9e571e047d6a5ee7fb88d1ab0124', '86f4bef60c24dce3dd8a7c11fe6bfa14910b85e8a92e6dd7652885ccc322f761', true, true, '{"year":1940,"brand":"Patek Philippe","model":"Calatrava","style":"dress","caliber":"Cal. 12-120","has_box":null,"winding":"manual","currency":"USD","brand_key":"patekphilippe","condition":null,"reference":"1543","dial_color":null,"has_papers":null,"description":"A 1940s Patek Philippe Calatrava ref. 1543 in a solid 34.5mm 18K yellow gold case with fancy tear drop lugs, powered by a manually wound Patek caliber 12-120.","price_cents":1699500,"case_size_mm":34.5,"case_material":"yellow_gold","complications":[]}'::jsonb, 'c7315399e662784e3c80edd3b2e390c6791d9e571e047d6a5ee7fb88d1ab0124', '86f4bef60c24dce3dd8a7c11fe6bfa14910b85e8a92e6dd7652885ccc322f761', 'de0d2add718702bebeae475d8dfbce4a3ff7472fe6e9c3b74a2782f928f7d247', null, 'a17cef0f-3574-4219-9fad-b439970224ce', '2026-09-14T15:48:11.878242+00:00', '2026-09-22T01:08:52.208+00:00'),
  ('c9019070-3085-416a-9260-69fd7bcdfdba', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:6a63b9d82863cf53bc47a66d', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1960s-blancpain-dress-watch-18k-yg-w-green-enamel-breguet-rotary-dial', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW548","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-09-01T07:51:39.248Z","photoCount":10,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-07-24T19:18:14.555Z"},"text":"An absurd and extremely rare 1960s Blancpain Dress Watch in a 34mm 18K yellow gold coin edge case with a rotary style dial featuring applied green enamel orbs with gold Breguet numerals, matching green enameled handset and cabochon crown, also with its original Blainpain box and AW signed buckle. \nThis watch has barely been worn and is in like new condition. Its lugs sharp and hallmarks deep. It’s manually wound Blainpain caliber is running well and keeping time.","title":"1960''s Blancpain Dress Watch 18K YG w/ Green Enamel Breguet Rotary Dial","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/bd40ff19-c563-4612-93a2-d2a4e34ceb32/B0004344.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/405e7ee2-c3cc-422d-a832-6e06e009dbd1/B0004415.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/0718c2d3-9792-4f1b-80e2-4a39bf1e393f/B0004349.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/66fe12f4-718f-4204-8962-c4c6bc2be5db/B0004446.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/3cee5897-c9d8-4aaf-82dc-fafeff90dab9/B0004423.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/6668a3a6-5f54-49be-90df-d597def88efe/B0004404.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/436ac8a6-4a1e-4064-9a7b-869c47336110/B0004389.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/cf4a9d7a-049a-4ea9-ac5a-4d1512c8c331/B0004385.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/704ba877-a4b9-4417-a4d2-9b0638eda9e2/B0004364.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/718b6813-b778-4af9-bf89-db5cac701531/B0004355.jpg?format=1500w"],"sourceUrl":"https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1960s-blancpain-dress-watch-18k-yg-w-green-enamel-breguet-rotary-dial","externalId":"squarespace:6a63b9d82863cf53bc47a66d","priceCents":2699500}'::jsonb, '45cdef8c01a48611ccadde88c92c5cd7d072600b85fbf74338a38241ad088f76', 'c90ca222201b95f7aa45276224fdef15980aff656d73930b337b6044d1c6f43b', true, true, '{"year":1960,"brand":"Blancpain","model":"Dress Watch","style":"dress","caliber":"Blancpain","has_box":true,"winding":"manual","currency":"USD","brand_key":"blancpain","condition":"like new","reference":null,"dial_color":"green","has_papers":false,"description":"This is a rare 1960s Blancpain Dress Watch in a 34mm 18K yellow gold case with a green enamel rotary style dial. It features applied green enamel orbs and gold Breguet numerals, and is in like new condition.","price_cents":2699500,"case_size_mm":34,"case_material":"yellow_gold","complications":[]}'::jsonb, '45cdef8c01a48611ccadde88c92c5cd7d072600b85fbf74338a38241ad088f76', 'c90ca222201b95f7aa45276224fdef15980aff656d73930b337b6044d1c6f43b', '1a3f45bef496528c0375be023e0887cb6d219f0711f163ba9c79f27242b2a34b', null, '647fc8f1-9628-4188-bb99-489eea7af11f', '2026-09-14T15:48:11.878242+00:00', '2026-09-22T01:08:52.208+00:00'),
  ('7579ae60-f782-4079-8dca-1fefc1412925', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:6a70ebde98f72327f7992fea', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1970s-patek-philippe-ref-3633-w-onyx-stone-dial-18k-yg', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW544","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-09-01T09:25:15.280Z","photoCount":8,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-08-03T19:30:49.171Z"},"text":"A spectacular 1970s Patek Philippe ref. 3633 in a sharp 34mm x 29mm 18K yellow gold case featuring the prominent ribbed texture made famous on this reference, with a flawless deep and dark black Onyx stone dial, free of any cracks or chips, its case retaining clear and crisp hallmarks also achieving a reddish patina over the decades, indicative of a life free from abuse of polish or overwear. \nIt’s manually wound Patek cal. 177 is running well and keeping accurate time. We do not have service history. Extract from the archives has been ordered.","title":"1970''s Patek Philippe ref. 3633 w/ Onyx Stone Dial 18K YG","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/e827d5b6-7bfd-45c5-84fb-b31c97dc3a43/B0004946.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/472a5e67-b420-405c-acaf-597f19d3a775/B0004984.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/cb523e27-c385-499f-94e6-7ce497d427d4/B0004973.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/f643f316-5951-4356-9206-7887460797fc/B0004971.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/73d00c56-2386-4412-8a77-37bcba6f9956/B0004968.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/f184c8e9-6839-41f1-a040-63cc10015728/B0004966.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/c7c56ab8-4ae0-4bba-bd3a-de371513b01a/B0004960.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/89b44ba3-447c-47e9-b6f3-0b820bdd916a/B0004952.jpg?format=1500w"],"sourceUrl":"https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1970s-patek-philippe-ref-3633-w-onyx-stone-dial-18k-yg","externalId":"squarespace:6a70ebde98f72327f7992fea","priceCents":3999500}'::jsonb, '073ffba343818b37740434e8d1fd172c77561fc96cce6a895e9820fce9690a05', '7e2709d99cafda9906cf5e145882c52f46caf61ca3c838254879c7b7424a44be', true, true, '{"year":1970,"brand":"Patek Philippe","model":"ref. 3633","style":"dress","caliber":"cal. 177","has_box":null,"winding":"manual","currency":"USD","brand_key":"patekphilippe","condition":null,"reference":"3633","dial_color":"black","has_papers":null,"description":"This Patek Philippe ref. 3633 from the 1970s features a ribbed texture 18K yellow gold case and a flawless black Onyx stone dial. It has a manually wound Patek cal. 177 movement that is running well.","price_cents":3999500,"case_size_mm":34,"case_material":"yellow_gold","complications":[]}'::jsonb, '073ffba343818b37740434e8d1fd172c77561fc96cce6a895e9820fce9690a05', '7e2709d99cafda9906cf5e145882c52f46caf61ca3c838254879c7b7424a44be', '28e62908b5b9a399ed406e70d7664057d90f70f299a6fd607891e44dc5724fb8', null, '5f8d946d-6c44-44b9-95ce-670c16a795f9', '2026-09-14T15:48:11.878242+00:00', '2026-09-22T01:08:52.208+00:00'),
  ('c2769f7e-3c8f-4912-aa1c-33be9dbc91e6', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:6a96045758cbf6266d65b784', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1960s-omega-speedmaster-professional-ref-145022-69ba', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW565","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-09-01T13:45:43.482Z","photoCount":6,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-08-31T22:52:34.807Z"},"text":"A special and rare 1960’s Omega Speedmaster Professional in solid 18K YG, made in limited quantities with only 1014 ever crafted, the first 33 of which were gifted to astronauts, celebrities and important members of program, the remaining were sold at retail. The example here, in fantastic condition, with sharp bezel, twisted lugs retaining its factory brushing, signed Omega crown and signed crystal, is an early numbered under 40, so very close to the original 32 that were gifted. \n Its 861 Omega caliber is running well and keeping accurate time.","title":"1960''s Omega Speedmaster Professional ref. 145.022-69BA","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/0da963d9-1f17-4c0f-a56f-007e28c0d9ea/B0006036.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/9ebe9090-c3b6-4c01-97b8-d1ad562a726d/B0006038.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/cb686bb6-36a1-4f51-bdff-4177bbfdb006/B0006041.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/96b0899f-a4a1-4d88-a23b-be578f8bdd91/B0006049.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/937102a7-a054-411a-ac05-9dd1d2d1e456/B0006052.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/d2d85eb1-0a54-4f7a-abd0-19ebc402f52c/B0006055.jpg?format=1500w"],"sourceUrl":"https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1960s-omega-speedmaster-professional-ref-145022-69ba","external