  ('7f99fa90-c615-4d07-b936-2b17d1723fbf', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:6a6d32d798f72327f796da7f', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1950s-universal-genve-cioccolatone-w-clous-de-paris-dial-18k-pink-gold', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW552","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-09-01T09:02:53.816Z","photoCount":10,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-07-31T23:47:44.178Z"},"text":"A fabulous and uncommon 1950s Universal Genève Cioccolatone in 18K Rose Gold, with a gorgeous dial of “Clous De Paris” guilloche, measuring 36mm x 25mm, it’s George Croisier crafted case like an hour glass, presents elegantly upon the wrist with both subtlety and panache on display in equal measure, all enhanced by a textured dial whose applied rose indices have taken their own individualized patinated journeys. \nIt’s manually wound UG caliber is running well and keeping accurate time. We do not have service history.","title":"1950''s Universal Genève Cioccolatone w/ Clous De Paris Dial 18K Pink Gold","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/a15347a4-8f4e-4e22-9393-1a918e1ae6ec/B0004825.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/d0eabfcf-185b-4081-9139-c7f741525c52/B0004864.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/90c162fb-3803-4796-967e-15ededae15f7/B0004873.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/93ac0f67-fb1e-4e40-a44b-e68cb8b1fdf6/B0004831.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/30fe8053-cc91-4338-b092-cad1fd2a2569/B0004871.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/6970a2c5-f556-461a-a05f-b1806516693b/B0004868.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/2aaeea60-5626-4ecb-a1f5-86f9ee1aaef6/B0