  ('f89ce1a8-2a3e-4767-ab2f-ec65346c806c', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:6aa1d0b3124c224337494234', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1970s-vacheron-constantin-automatic-screwback-calatrava-ref-6394', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW569","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-09-09T21:39:06.734Z","photoCount":8,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-09-09T21:36:03.230Z"},"text":"A stupendous 1970s Vacheron & Constantin Dress Watch ref. 6394 with copious details, notably on an insane bracelet with cobblestone style links, vertically textured with parallel lines, a stepped florentine screwback case with brushed lugs, its linen textured dial with applied gold indices filled with onyx, powered by the self-winding Vacheron Cal. K1072/1.","title":"1970''s Vacheron Constantin Automatic Screwback Calatrava ref. 6394 in 18K YG","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/4a930993-580d-4fe2-9409-a54651f3d8ca/B0006422.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/b261c9ce-ac86-4576-a4f2-ba62df976975/B0006458.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/1b95f636-36a5-4e00-a502-8730499fc906/B0006437.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/90f92fe9-5e8f-45e1-bd7f-83e83df5996f/B0006479.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/d181038b-61b1-43de-9fd1-37717590ab84/B0006467.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/4d22110c-1830-43a9-9639-acc9e0c45df6/B0006464.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/8c43ce22-216c-43db-8412-c25a07501005/B0006450.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/b57e2957-bb09-4c70-b438-8b8fdf8c83e5/B0006445.jpg?format=1500w"],"sourc