  ('15497b38-5b3b-4953-ac4c-b85c93161ed4', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:6a07c16c9bbeeb1bb610c24c', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1940s-movado-curviplan-tank-w-two-tone-sector-dial', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW481","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T21:40:50.531Z","photoCount":8,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-05-16T01:00:30.916Z"},"text":"A beautiful 1940s Movado Curviplan in a large 40x23mm curved stainless steel case with a very rare two-tone sector dial, retaining its crisp and clear printing, its case sharp with broad bevels in tact, contrasted by even vertical satin brushing across its midcase and bezel, powered by the Movado caliber 510, which has just been serviced and is running well.","title":"1940''s Movado Curviplan Tank w/ Two-Tone Sector Dial","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/c146c41b-254b-4b24-9746-3a7ffa143af9/DSC01917.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/fd6bdfd5-e9bd-40fd-bae7-364707928140/DSC01923.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/193df6c0-8137-47b0-81c8-18d15b53d5de/DSC01928.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/efb1db44-f7d9-441a-96a4-dcf5c728ef46/DSC01938.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/9f5c882a-63b1-44d2-9dba-53bf4b8bab47/DSC01943.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/9324e1c5-cd76-44de-969b-6bf16755dccf/DSC01947.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/d24c50f1-0535-4698-a654-c991ec846045/DSC01958.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/cff955d2-c78f-4622-8185-d7d513eae444/DSC01970.jpg?format=1500w"],"sourceUrl":"https://goldfingersvintage.com