  ('4bb83ab1-17d7-44fc-a961-7d196ddd350a', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:69ea727afd523c3b259a6ef7', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1950s-audemars-piguet-tank-carr-w-hinged-lugs-18k-yg', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW454","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T18:12:52.132Z","photoCount":9,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-04-23T19:31:30.814Z"},"text":"A phenomenal and extremely rare 1950s Audemars Piguet Tank Carr&eacute; Extra-Plate featuring fully articulating lugs, in 18K yellow gold, this extraordinary case, measuring a broad yet very wearable 36mm x 28mm, was crafted by the famed Markowski Maison, notable amongst casemakers of this era for their beautiful exotic geometric designs employed by the most revered brands, this example is nearly flawless, remaining unpolished, with a undisturbed dial featuring applied Arabic indices and powered by a manually wound AP cal keeping wonderful time.","title":"1950''s Audemars Piguet Tank Carré w/ Hinged Lugs 18K YG","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/6e0547eb-3922-41f5-98a5-1e0a04ad3ee8/DSC00254.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/907e1468-8203-4588-a03d-8f304848f63a/DSC00266.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/786c05b3-1048-45c2-94ad-0910f1c6447e/DSC00269.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/e23c9d18-0ee6-4f04-94d6-3173c66a6985/DSC00272.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/c1f88750-efee-420f-a407-270b99bc6816/DSC00286.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/85855be0-6d27-4bbf-8793-836758c87b14/DSC00293.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/fcb03818-3d81-42d8-aec4-5bb595ebf834/DSC00298.jp