  ('62c8c847-b535-49e7-bca4-62c4040f7e8d', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:699f6d080ccc755adde651cd', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1950s-movado-m90-chronograph-ref-19038-pulsations', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW414","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T09:08:48.855Z","photoCount":8,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-02-25T21:45:23.392Z"},"text":"An incredible and very rare 1950s Movado M90 Chronograph ref. 19033 in a large unpolished 37mm stepped steel case and off white dial with blue pulsations scale, applied rose gilt indices, signature and hands.\nThis seldom worn wristwatch is indicative of the prowess Maison Movado demonstrated during their golden era, producing some of the world’s finest chronographs purpose built for daily use and reliability, while never comprising on aesthetics.\nThis example was recently serviced and is running well.","title":"1950''s Movado M90 Chronograph ref. 19033 \"Pulsations\"","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/3a594cfe-d0e6-4848-8e3e-9b9d3bd976a3/DSC08044.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/4014fbe2-996c-4d83-85ea-4f56129889f6/DSC08060.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/3b4cf7f5-0677-459f-ad9b-87b5de8c445e/DSC08083.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/a3fde8d5-eda2-4ed5-ae3a-8249d2fcbd4d/DSC08075.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/20376891-e535-481d-aa0c-ef6e743f7ec8/DSC08068.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/8904448e-3987-476a-84f3-815a024c26ef/DSC08081.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/925a31e0-de00-43d4-9687-52705967aac2/DSC08064.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cd