  ('766e654c-e988-43f1-8039-6a18142290e7', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:699cb41e0ccc755adde37ddf', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1930s-tavannes-art-deco-tank-18k-yg', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW412","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T08:45:02.876Z","photoCount":11,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-02-23T20:14:11.640Z"},"text":"A spectacular 1930s Art Deco masterpiece by Tavannes, imported to France, in solid 18K yellow gold, with details only the era of which it was produced would yield like its enamel engraved stylized numeral bezel, guilloche case back, blued Cathedral hands and triple lined accents throughout the curved hidden lug chasis holding it all together. \nIt’s Cyma Tavannes caliber is running well and keeping great time.","title":"1930''s Tavannes Art Deco Tank 18K YG","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/692f4158-53c0-4600-ae70-7b8d91427c9f/DSC07862.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/b553d7c9-225f-4fbb-bd25-21f059288de4/DSC07894.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/a818238d-dddc-4cdd-a638-0739ba6caa5a/DSC07874.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/dd02e5dd-9011-421f-a036-1b533db72b56/DSC07887.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/6281dcc3-9e9f-4dd8-97f9-fb7647331a08/DSC07889.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/84b8aa28-7913-4181-8f9b-1ac256c1c692/DSC07896.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/e422776c-1f46-4794-a261-2f3ac1a0cd03/DSC07898.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/152edd6d-7c79-401a-9128-5373b29b6185/DSC07901.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squar