  ('7343f2dc-8fdb-4fde-832a-c5a78038ad2d', 'ad0d7d71-741a-4b65-9465-641ed9cc0199', 'squarespace', 'squarespace:6a29cc4158b73f530a71c679', 'https://goldfingersvintage.com/watches/p/1950s-patek-philippe-ref-2488-jumbo-carr-w-extract', '{"meta":{"sku":"GVW507","vendor":null,"updatedAt":"2026-09-01T01:29:51.458Z","photoCount":8,"productType":null,"publishedAt":"2026-06-10T20:44:51.416Z"},"text":"A very handsome 1950s Patek Philippe reference 2488, this large square tank in 18K yellow gold measures 27mm x 27mm and commands a pleasing presence on the wrist with its sloping contoured corners tapering off to its eagle beak style lugs, its large silvered dial with applied stick indices shows very little wear with pleasing sheen, and its Patek cal. 10-200 is running well. \nIt comes with its extract from the Patek Philippe archives.","title":"1950''s Patek Philippe ref. 2488 \"Jumbo Carré\" w/ Extract","currency":"USD","available":true,"photoUrls":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/710169b9-ec1e-428a-a5a9-27d6d2a1dcca/B0001745.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/149cf591-256d-4010-88c2-133418e4a65f/B0001763.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/6c9243a7-7847-477c-ada5-dcdcb4e969d1/B0001767.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/cc0b19e6-ac7e-4ce2-8dd1-1ec6e2a5ffbe/B0001770.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/f142c4f8-c708-4990-b882-748fe7443d3f/B0001779.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/ee99ca08-5025-41a2-9467-1f804480cb8b/B0001786.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/0cfbc615-9ca9-41e3-bdc3-6f66e7b3b817/B0001788.jpg?format=1500w","https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64d53a504f5aee6d2b32ee14/7b182b00-6735-41f1-bcdf